  "limitations": [
    "This 48-row published dataset was previously benchmarked in this repository. The split is retrospective and is not fresh prospective untouched evidence.",
    "One 100m site, two published directions, three days and peak windows; 16 correlated means on the test day are not 16 independent vehicle samples.",
